I have run a split-split-plot analysis of variance in the following manner:
        test <- aov(ht96 ~ trt + blk + stk + rep + tend + trt:stk + trt:tend
+ stk:tend 
                + Error(trt:blk + stk:rep + tend:stk:rep), data=mia.aov,
na.action = na.exclude)

        summary(test, split = list(
                trt = list(sc vs mu = 1, mu vs li = 2, N vs W = 3, SM vs FM
= 4, ES vs BS = 5),
                stk = list(Sw vs Pw = 1, Sw s vs l = 2, Pw s vs l = 3)))

I have now come to question my use of all fixed factors, raising the
