DataSet is supposed to be a dataset name, not an expression.  The GUI will 
prompt for a dataset name with your syntax, at least for me.

Try

foo <- x[["ele1"]]
guiPlot( PlotType = "Histogram", DataSet = "foo", Columns = "a1")

