> I'm using splus 6.2 in windows

There's a `font' par which unfortunately has a device-specific meaning. 
On postscript()

plot(1:10)
text(2, 5, "Some text", font = 4)

is italic (as is 10) -- ps.options()$fonts tells you the font list for 
postscript().

What device did you want?

