Hi Nathan,

Try "as.numeric"

# tDdata
#      Event        DOB
# 1 07/11/2004 01/22/1965
# 2 06/12/2004 02/12/1974
# 3 08/11/2004 08/01/1959

as.numeric(tDdata$Event-tDdata$DOB)    # duration in days
as.numeric(tDdata$Event-tDdata$DOB)/365.25    # duration in years

Best,
Kristian

