It means exactly what it says.  For multinomial regression not all your 12 
response columns can be zero.

If that is intentional, you need to omit cases for which all columns are 
zero (they are completely uniformative).   However, I do wonder if you are 
really dealing with a problem with mutually exclusive outcomes for which 
multinomial regression is appropriate.

